  "transcript_asr": "Let's say a specific agricultural supplier calls you in a panic and informs you that a massive batch of raw ingredients was contaminated. Ooh, a recall situation. Right. You need to instantly trace that supplier's exposure through your entire global supply chain. Which specific intermediate products contain that batch, which exact multimodal shipments carried those products, which which specific retail stores received those shipments and which exact refrigeration units are currently holding them on the floor.",
